Descriptor ReasonExited
    documentation 'This descriptor defines the reason a student exited a program.
    with optional map type
        item Died or is permanently incapacitated
        item Reached maximum age
        item Discontinued schooling
        item Suspended or expelled from school
        item Graduated with a high school diploma
        item Received certificate of completion, modified diploma, or finished IEP requirements
        item Transferred to another district or school
        item Moved out of state
        item Withdrawal by a parent (or guardian)
        item Other
        item Unknown reason